 one written by a human student, one written by ChatGPT \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  could you tell the difference? Probably not. And that is exactly the problem."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
