"Models like GPT-4, Claude, Llama, and Gemini now produce text that is grammatically perfect, contextually coherent, and stylistically very similar to human writing. This is both impressive and dangerous."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Point 2 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Serious risks across domains}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 

\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Think about what this means. In academia \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  students submitting AI-written assignments. In journalism 
\hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  fake news articles. In medicine \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  AI-generated misinformation that looks like a real clinical study. In law \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  fabricated documents."}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Point 3 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Early detection methods}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Early systems tried to detect AI text using things called perplexity scores \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 basically measuring how 'predictable' the text is. And stylometric features \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  analyzing writing style. These worked somewhat but were not very accurate."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Point 4 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Transformers improved accuracy}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 

\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Then came powerful models like RoBERTa and DistilBERT \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 these are AI models specifically trained to detect AI text. They achieved much higher accuracy. But they came with a serious problem..."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Point 5 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  The black box problem}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "These transformer models work like a black box. They say 'this text is AI-generated' \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 but they cannot tell you WHY. They cannot explain which words or sentences led to that conclusion. An educator cannot discipline a student, a court cannot accept evide\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
nce, based on a system that cannot explain its own reasoning."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Point 6 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  XAI is the solution}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "This is why Explainable Artificial Intelligence \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  XAI \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 became essential. We need detection systems that not only detect, but also EXPLAIN. That is the central theme of this entire review."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Point to the 3 stat cards on the right:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
