\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 What to say:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Now let me explain how I conducted this systematic review. I followed the PRISMA framework \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses. This is the gold standard methodology for research synthesis."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Walk through the 4 stages:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Stage 1 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Identify:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
"I searched 4 databases: Google Scholar, ArXiv, IEEE Xplore, and SciSpace. Together they returned 250 papers. After removing 68 duplicates, I had 182 unique records."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Stage 2 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Screen:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
"I read the title and abstract of all 182 papers. 126 were excluded because they either didn't address AI text detection, had no XAI component, or were published before 2023. That left 56 papers."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Stage 3 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Eligible:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "I read the full text of all 56 papers. 44 more were excluded \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 18 had no formal XAI method, 12 had datasets that were too small (under 500 samples), and 14 others failed different criteria."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Stage 4 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Include:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "The final result: 12 high-quality studies published between 2023 and 2026, all using LIME or SHAP for explainable AI text detection."}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Right side \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Inclusion criteria:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "For a paper to be included, it had to meet all these conditions \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 published in the right time window, directly addressing AI text detection, using at least one XAI method, written in English, with a dataset of at least 500 samples, and reporting standard\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
 metrics like accuracy, F1-score, or AUC."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Importantly \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 I used thematic synthesis rather than statistical meta-analysis, because the studies used very different architectures and datasets. You cannot simply average numbers that come from completely different experimental setups."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
