\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Every study measures detection accuracy with F1-score and AUC. But how do you measure the QUALITY of an explanation? Is it faithful 
\hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  does it actually represent what the model computed? Is it stable \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  does the same text always get the same explanation? I\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 s it useful \hich\f31506 
\emdash \loch\f31506  does it actually help a human make a better decision? Nobody has tested this formally. Without this, the word 'explainable' is a marketing claim, not a scientific one."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Gap 3 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Fairness for Non-Native Writers (HIGH):}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "This is an ethical gap that I find deeply concerning. The features that flag AI text \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506 
 grammatical standardization, formulaic language, low lexical entropy \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  are EQUALLY characteristic of non-native English speakers. A student from Pakistan, China, or Sa\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
udi Arabia writing in careful, grammatically correct English could easily be flagged as AI-generated. No study has empirically tested this. It is a massive fairness risk."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Gap 4 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Cross-Domain Generalization (HIGH):}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
"The legal domain has not been tested by ANY study in this review. Medical text has one study. A model trained on general web text will perform poorly on legal contracts or clinical notes, because human experts in those fields also write in highly regular
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 , formulaic language \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  just like LLMs. The generalization problem is not just acknowledged, it is not yet understood mechanically."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Gap 5 \hich\f31506 \emdash \loch\f31506  Multilingual Detection (MODERATE):}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
