\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Let me now bring everything together with the two principal findings of this review."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Positive finding:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
"The principal positive finding is convergent validity. LIME and SHAP, applied across architecturally diverse detection systems and varied datasets, consistently identify the same core markers of LLM authorship: grammatical standardization, formulaic tran
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 sitions, low lexical entropy, and suppressed epistemic hedging. This convergence across fundamentally different methods is strong evidence these are genuine, stable properties of machine-generated prose."}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Critical finding:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
"The principal critical finding is that the field has not reconciled transparency with robustness. The adversarial paradox remains open. Most domain-by-LLM combinations are unstudied. Fairness for non-native writers is unaddressed empirically."}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Four institutional implications:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\insrsid16654193\charrsid16654193 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 "Based on this review, four practical implications follow for institutions deploying these systems:"}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 
